5. Count Occurrences of Anagrams
Problem

Given a text and a pattern, count how many substrings of the text are anagrams of the pattern.

6. Fruit Into Baskets (At Most 2 Distinct)
Problem

Find the longest subarray containing at most 2 distinct numbers.

7. Longest Repeating Character Replacement
Problem

Replace at most k characters to make the longest substring with the same character.

Sliding Window Template (Variable Size)

Expand: move right

Shrink: move left

Maintain condition: uniqueness, sum limit, distinct count, frequency constraint, etc.

